"means, for example, your upgrade path from version `2.4` to `5.1` (assuming "
"this is the current stable) would be: `2.4` → `3.0` → `4.0` → `5.0` → "
"`latest stable (5.1)`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:19
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
